Z||000013||Songman||10-01-2001||12:25 PM||||     <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Voytek:<BR><B>Songman said he was leaving for good after he got p'd off in a thread about loud pipes.  I think that was everyone's cue to start kissin' some a$$ and plead with him to stay (kinda like what Fierokid was trying to do).<P>No one did so now to keep his face he has to lay low.<P>Duhhhh!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Actually, this is the kind of bullshit that I left the forum for. Always someone with a smart ass remark. And always the wrong information too... The thread in question was not about loud pipes, it was about loud radios. Someone (not me) mentioned pipes and I became the scapegoat for the loud radio crowd since I ride a Harley. Anything to get off the subject.<P>And I am not laying low to save face. I have been corresponding with lots of people in PM and answering questions when I can. I am in contact with the people I like and those of you that go from thread to thread trying to start arguments, and you know who you are, can kiss my ass....<P>Voytek, I think what pisses you off is that I don't want to come back here and you ran your smart ass hole about "He'll be back". I don't want attention. I have my life other than Fieros and that suits me just fine. Everytime I think I might make a post here I see more of the same sad bullshit that is ruining what was once a nice place to hang out.<P>The people that I have met and became friends with on this forum know me for who I am. You'll have a hard time finding anyone who knows me to say that I am less than fair and nice to everyone. If you are wanting a character battle, I think you better go find someone you can be more evenly matched with.<P>And one more thing, Voytek. Go ahead and spew your venom because that is what you do. Everytime you open your mouth you accomplish two tasks: You prove what you really are, and you prove that my decision to not participate anymore was correct. I am returning to the peace, calm, and friendship of PM and the happiness I found when not responding to you.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Songman (edited 10-01-2001).]||||reg||8
Z||000014||Voytek||10-01-2001||01:46 PM||||HOLY SH!T!!!!!!! Talk about flying off the handle!  I don't usually lose my temper on here, but you've really done it.<P>Allow me to correct myself first: yeah, the topic started about loud stereos but ended on loud pipes.  I beg your forgiveness.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>   <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>If you are wanting a character battle, I think you better go find someone you can be more evenly matched with.<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I didn't ask for a character battle - what the f*ck are you talking about?!  Just like a smarta$$ in another topic said - this place is about opinions.  I've explained what, in my opinion, was the reason that prompted you to finally leave and what I believe you were looking for with your final post.<P>Do you really want to get into a character battle?  There is someone on this forum who can make you look like a real lying shmuck.  I've been asked not to get into it, though, and I'll respect their request.<P>I don't give a flying f*ck if you don't come back here.  In fact, I quite enjoyed it here without your bragging on how smart you are and how much money you've got.<P>You've owned Corvettes, Jags, boats, make over a hundred grand a year and you hang out here with your 17 year old Fiero.  Tell me another one.<P>   <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Everytime you open your mouth you accomplish two tasks: You prove what you really are<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Go read some of my other posts.  I post in technical and general Fiero chat.  I get along with everyone else just fine and try to respond as intelligently as I can.  I do, however hate cocky-lying-asses like yourself.<P>Now go and remove that gerbil from your ass and I hope your day will get better.<P>One more thing mr. Songman.   <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>you ran your smart ass hole about "He'll be back".<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Need I say more?<P><p>[This message has been edited by Voytek (edited 10-01-2001).]||||reg||1
